  },
  "seedRoutineDescStrongLifts5x5": "Mehdi Hadim’s three-day novice barbell program. Alternate two workouts built around five sets of five; deadlift remains one set of five.",
  "@seedRoutineDescStrongLifts5x5": {
    "description": "What one of the programs the app ships is, shown on the screen that offers it and on the routine it lands as. Plain and factual — no marketing."
  },
  "seedRoutineDescFullBody3x": "Three full-body sessions a week, each with a squat or hinge, a press, a pull and some core work. For training three times a week without keeping track of a split.",
  "@seedRoutineDescFullBody3x": {
    "description": "What one of the programs the app ships is, shown on the screen that offers it and on the routine it lands as. Plain and factual — no marketing."
  },
  "seedRoutineDescTwoDayFullBody": "Two sessions a week, each with a squat or a hinge, a press, a pull and some core work. For a week that has two training days in it rather than four.",
  "@seedRoutineDescTwoDayFullBody": {
    "description": "What one of the programs the app ships is, shown on the screen that offers it and on the routine it lands as. Plain and factual — no marketing."
  },
  "seedRoutineDescBodyweightBasics": "Three sessions a week with no equipment beyond a floor and something to hang from. Add reps first; when the top of the range gets easy, move to a harder version of the same movement.",
  "@seedRoutineDescBodyweightBasics": {
    "description": "What one of the programs the app ships is, shown on the screen that offers it and on the routine it lands as. Plain and factual — no marketing."
  },
  "seedRoutineDescDumbbellFullBody": "Three whole-body sessions a week on one pair of dumbbells. Everything is pressed, pulled or carried with the weight in your hands, so it works in a spare room as well as in a gym.",
  "@seedRoutineDescDumbbellFullBody": {
    "description": "What one of the programs the app ships is, shown on the screen that offers it and on the routine it lands as. Plain and factual — no marketing."
  },
  "seedRoutineDescIntervalConditioning": "Two conditioning sessions a week, measured in seconds rather than reps: rounds of hard work against the clock with a short rest between them. Meant to be trained alongside a strength program, not instead of one.",
  "@seedRoutineDescIntervalConditioning": {
    "description": "What one of the programs the app ships is, shown on the screen that offers it and on the routine it lands as. Plain and factual — no marketing."
