  "itemEditorAddWeightAtTop": "Progress by reps, then weight",
  "@itemEditorAddWeightAtTop": {
    "description": "Checkbox label in the Progression card's Advanced half, and the name of the Advanced axis it switches the slot to: climb the rep goal to the top of the range, then add weight and start the reps again at the bottom. Always listed, and greyed out on a slot with no rep range to climb."
