  "itemEditorProgressionRule": "Add {step} after {cleans, plural, =1{1 clean session} other{{cleans} clean sessions}}; drop {back} after {misses, plural, =1{1 missed session} other{{misses} missed sessions in a row}}.",
  "@itemEditorProgressionRule": {
    "description": "The four progression numbers read back as the rule they add up to: \"Add 2.5 kg after 2 clean sessions; drop 5 kg after 3 missed sessions in a row.\" A single miss has nothing to be in a row with, so that branch says so in the singular and drops the phrase. The amounts arrive already formatted in their own unit.",
    "placeholders": {
