    "description": "Warning under the theme preview when body text does not have enough contrast against the background. This is guidance that changes what somebody does next, so it has to read naturally rather than literally — keep it plain and specific. The quoted word names the \"Text\" role in the editor above, so use the same wording you gave themeRoleText."
  },
  "themePreviewMarkersWarning": "\"Completed\" and \"Missed goal\" look alike. A glance down a column of sets should tell them apart.",
